# The lip pass's own environment (main/lipPass.mjs): LivePortrait, torch on MPS, and MediaPipe's face mesh to measure it.
# numpy and opencv match hf-media's lock. The lock lists every package and installs with --no-deps, so mediapipe comes
# without jax, sounddevice and opencv-contrib, which its face mesh never loads (it does need matplotlib). Regenerate:
#   MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=14.0 uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes --no-header \
#     --python-platform aarch64-apple-darwin --python-version 3.12 -o locks/macos-arm64.txt
#   then append `uv pip compile` of "mediapipe==0.10.14" with --no-deps and the same flags.
